flowchart TD
  A[Commit] --> B[Pre-commit]
  B --> C[Pull request]
  C --> D[Test / lint / SAST / dependency scan]
  D --> E[Build / image scan / SBOM / sign]
  E --> F[Staging GitOps promotion]
  F --> G[Canary analysis]
  G --> H{Approved production promotion?}
  H -->|No| I[Stop]
  H -->|Yes| J[Production canary]
  J --> K{SLOs pass?}
  K -->|Yes| L[100% production]
  K -->|No| M[Automatic abort and rollback]
